[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/legal_document.gd" id="1"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
text = "Terms of Service\n\nPublisher: 林贵鸿\nContact email: linguihong000@gmail.com\nEffective date: October 25, 2026\n\nBy installing or using SpriteBonk (the \"App\"), published by 林贵鸿, you agree to these terms.\n\n1. The App\n\nThe App is a single-player game provided for entertainment. It requires no account and no wallet. An optional feature lets you paste a public Solana address to view its address and SOL balance inside the App.\n\n2. Not a wallet; no transactions\n\nThe App is not a wallet and does not custody assets. In this version it cannot sign messages, approve transactions, or move funds, and it never requests private keys or seed phrases — never enter them anywhere in the App. Balance information comes from a public Solana RPC endpoint, is read-only, and may be delayed or inaccurate. Nothing in the App is financial advice.\n\n3. Virtual items and future features\n\nThis version contains no in-app purchases and sells nothing. References in the App or its store listing to planned future features (including a $SPRT token or Genesis NFT eligibility in a later season update) describe plans only: they are not offers, not part of this version, and may change or never ship.\n\n4. Acceptable use\n\nYou agree not to reverse-engineer the App except where applicable law permits it, not to misrepresent the App or its publisher, and not to use the App in violation of applicable law or the Solana dApp Store Publisher Policy.\n\n5. Intellectual property\n\nThe App and its original content are owned by the publisher or its licensors. These terms grant you a personal, non-transferable, revocable license to install and play the App; they transfer no ownership.\n\n6. Availability and liability\n\nThe App is provided \"as is\" without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, the publisher is not liable for indirect or consequential damages arising from use of the App, including reliance on balance information shown in the App.\n\n7. Solana Mobile\n\nSolana Mobile, Inc. and its affiliates (the \"Solana Mobile Parties\") are not a party to these terms and have no responsibility or liability to you or any other end user in connection with the App. The warranty disclaimer and limitation of liability in Section 6 apply also for the benefit of the Solana Mobile Parties, to a degree no less protective of them than Sections 13 and 14 of the Solana Mobile dApp Store policies. To the maximum extent permitted by law, the Solana Mobile Parties shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the App or from its distribution through the Solana dApp Store.\n\n8. Changes\n\nWe may update these terms; the version hosted at this URL is the current one. Continued use after an update takes effect means you accept the updated terms.\n\nContact: linguihong000@gmail.com"
